Dirty equivalence and at-least1/2 aggregation independently exhaustively checked on 270 Boolean assignments, including zero-gate and one-gate edge cases. min_dirty=max(legacy --dirty, new minimum) preserves old meaning. Definition uses all complete maximal negatives; an AND true on any negative is dirty. This is a witness-search restriction only, not a proven necessary bound. Calibrator computes same per-gate property directly.
Diverse delta adds active AND count to archive identity and updates only key destructuring; exact evaluation, decoder, near recorder, reducer, and target checks unchanged. Active bitmask counts only backward-reachable rows with two operands.
